WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.220
Universal Century 0096.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.430
Banagher Links,

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:08.760
a student attending
the Anaheim Electronics Industrial College

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.550
at the colony Industrial 7,

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.930
has a fateful encounter with
a green-eyed girl falling from the sky.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:18.720
The girl is the Zeon princess Mineva Zabi.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.130
She is on a mission to prevent a war
from breaking out over Laplace's Box,

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.630
which is said to have the power
to overturn the Federation government.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.840
Cardeas Vist,
who is actually Banagher's father,

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:34.010
entrusts him with the Unicorn Gundam,
the key to Laplace's Box.

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:35.680
Father...

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.220
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.380
I must...

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:44.680
...go!

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.300
The Unicorn Gundam is a key

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:51.010
designed to disclose the whereabouts
of Laplace's Box in stages.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:54.480
Caught between the Earth Federation 
Forces and the Sleeves,

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.150
led by Full Frontal,

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:59.590
Banagher finds himself
dragged into a major conspiracy,

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:02.510
the curse of the Universal Century.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.180
I suppose it is.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.760
Even though we live our lives
trying to escape sadness...

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:16.590
Someone once told me to think of
a better way to use the Box.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.800
What if that's my...

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.680
However,
Banagher's mind is finally made up,

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:27.300
thanks to his encounter
with Captain Zinnerman of the Garencieres.

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:31.050
Meanwhile, Mineva has fled
Riddhe's family's mansion

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:33.800
and begun a new course of action.

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:38.090
The next coordinates
displayed by the La+ Program

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.880
point to Torrington base in Australia,

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:43.880
where a colony fell
during the One Year War.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:47.720
He has done us a great service,
perfecting Haman's legacy as he did.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:51.880
I would like you to assign us
the mission to attack Torrington.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:56.430
As Zeon remnant forces gather
from all around the world,

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.720
Loni Garvey, who is bound to the ghost
of her father by blood,

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.180
not unlike Banagher,

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:05.970
joins the operation
in the giant mobile armor Shamblo.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:13.930
This is a... This is nothing
but a slaughter!

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:47.180
Finish them all off!

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.970
(A PRIVATE WAR)

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.130
What are you doing?!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.760
I'm going out in the Unicorn.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.760
If I break the La+ Program's seal,

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.050
there won't be any reason
to do this, right?

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:55.760
You can't. If you go out now, you'll be
a sitting duck for those flak guns.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.760
Wait until we're finished mopping up.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.220
"Mopping up"?!

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:02.380
Lots of innocent people are dying
down there! Is that all right with you?!

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:05.260
It's an operation. What I think
doesn't enter into it.

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:10.300
Stay put.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.050
As I recall, we didn't tie you up
and haul you with us.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:18.430
If you didn't expect something like this,
you have a lack of imagination.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:21.430
This is what you do when
you seize enemy territory.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:25.180
Attacking an unrelated area
and crushing fleeing people...

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.680
This isn't war, not even close.
This is just an act of vengeance!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:33.090
That first time we met at Industrial 7,
you didn't shoot me, Captain.

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.550
I know this can't be
sitting well with you.

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:36.930
Please, make them stop.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:40.880
If this is your idea of war, why did
you take me across the desert?!

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:43.340
Why did you save Ms. Marida?!

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:47.340
She doesn't call you Master
because she's a cyber-Newtype.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.630
It's because her heart was saved
by you, Captain, just like mine was!

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.680
Shut your mouth!

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:57.050
I worried about you because
you're the key to the Box.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:00.340
I only won you over because I thought
it would make my job easier.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.630
You said this isn't war, right?

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:05.130
Open your eyes and take
a good, close look!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.340
Things like this happen in a war.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.470
There's no principle,
no honor, no dignity.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.680
Some people kill, others are killed,
that's all there is to it.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:18.510
And what's wrong with vengeance?
Our war hasn't ended yet!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.590
That's exactly how the Federation
soldiers who burned the Zeon town

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.590
rationalized what they did!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:49.970
Louise, I'm coming to you!

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:56.430
Even though people are sad, we live
our lives trying to escape sadness.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.010
You told me that!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:00.470
You little punk!

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:02.550
You know it, too!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:05.800
Doing this won't accomplish anything!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:08.090
You're just an ignorant little kid!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:15.510
I... We have been waiting for
this moment for a long, long time.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:18.510
So long that I want to get out
right now to help out!

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:21.800
Just because you've seen hell
with your own two eyes

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.590
doesn't mean you can force
that hell on other- -

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.220
If you don't quit your yammering,
so help me, I swear I'll- -

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.880
Do something about this kid!
Alec! Flaste!

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:40.010
Sorry, my hands are full right now, sir.
You'll have to do it yourself.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:42.180
You sons of- -

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:48.010
I don't get it...
I just don't understand this.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:53.880
But it's wrong to close off
your heart just because

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:58.380
there are too many sad
and painful things out there.

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:01.930
I don't want to forget the sadness
that people are feeling.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:05.550
The fact that we have hearts
is why we can feel sadness!

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:08.220
I want to become the sort of man
who can live with that!

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.050
The sort of man you are, Captain!

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:43.550
Banagher?

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:46.220
Mr. Tomura, please send out
the Unicorn Gundam.

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.970
I thought you were on standby.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:14.840
Loni, stop it! Leave from the
east side and head for the base!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:25.340
Are you sure about this? If I drop
him now, he'll be a sitting duck!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:35.180
It's all right. Let the kid do
what he wants. Right, Captain?

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:44.340
Captain, everyone on the Garencieres,
thank you for looking after me.

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.760
Banagher Links in the
Unicorn Gundam, here I go!

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.430
Release!

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:58.260
I'm not the key to some box.
I'm a human being.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:02.260
And you're a machine that
amplifies human abilities.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.880
That's what you were built for.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.970
For people who can sense other people's
hearts and feel their sadness.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:12.220
So don't let anger swallow you up.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.300
It's the Split-horn?
It's too soon, Garencieres!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.630
What's it- -

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.130
Has that boy betrayed us?

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:36.130
I'm going to break the Box's seal!
Fall back, you guys!

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:38.970
Why is the Box's key
getting in the way?!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.130
Kirks.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.840
Loni, what is it?

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.670
The Split-horn opened fire on me.

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:04.300
What do you mean?

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:09.300
It's time to go, Loni!

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:11.880
We've taken a long,
winding road to get here.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.090
If anyone stands in our way,
I'll crush them!

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.460
I don't like this.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:18.630
What is this, a walking war museum?

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.800
They've got guts,
attacking in suits like those.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:24.670
That's why we can't let our guard down.
We don't have tenacity like that.

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:31.420
Why are you doing this?!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.300
This is what I've been living for.

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.460
Banagher?!

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:36.460
I owe you all a debt of gratitude.

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:39.260
Thanks to the Garencieres
crashing in the desert,

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:42.170
we have the chance to take our
revenge after all these years.

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:46.840
You're too late. If you stop me,
this truly will have been for nothing.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:50.630
Get out of the way! And hurry up
and turn into the Split-horn!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:53.800
You can't! The people who were
killed here and their families

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:56.260
will only make your people
hated even more!

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:04.840
You're wasting your time...

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.630
Stop it!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:25.920
If this cycle continues, your heart will
break and you'll lose your humanity!

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:26.970
Shut your mouth!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.110
My father and mother
died in the hunt for Zeon remnants!

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:33.710
They were killed without being
allowed to surrender! Butchered!

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:38.590
I'm here because I devoted my life
to finishing what my father started!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.090
Your precious Box can stay shut!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:43.630
My hatred runs too deep for
something like that to dispel it!

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:45.590
Get out of my way!

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:53.260
Banagher!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.630
Ensign Riddhe, if we don't stop
that thing, the city will be- -

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:08.880
I know, but nothing we say will change
its pilot's mind. We have to destroy it.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.260
Brute force won't solve anything!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:14.550
She's enslaved, that's all!
That's not the real her.

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:15.960
I will stop her!

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:20.800
You're right, she is enslaved.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:23.210
By a blood curse
that can never be broken.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.800
Listen to me, Ms. Loni!

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:32.510
Is this what you really want?
Is this what the real you wants?!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.420
Ms. Loni!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.010
But, this is all I have...

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:41.800
I don't have anything else to live for.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.170
Then find something!

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:45.780
It's too sad to live for 
nothing but hatred and anger.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:50.130
It's only human to be angered
by injustice! People aren't gods!

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.050
Even so!
You have to stop this!

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:05.050
Are you crazy, Banagher?!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.050
It stopped...?

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:29.260
Father, Mother...
I...

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.920
I'll cover you!
Fall back!

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:57.920
Shit!

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:15.760
Watts!

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.130
I told you not to let your guard down!

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.840
One shot left, huh?

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.210
Bastard!

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.760
Loni...

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:45.800
You mustn't end up like us!

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.630
They killed Kirks?

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:07.880
The Federation took away another
person who protected me...

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.590
The last of my family!

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:11.420
Ms. Loni!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:15.170
This is the only place for me now!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.590
You can't fight reality.

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:41.630
I... I want to stop her.
I have to stop her!

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:42.960
Gundam!

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.960
Give me strength!

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:04.840
Gundam...

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.010
- Lieutenant...
- That's...

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:08.420
Yeah.

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.130
Move!

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:39.010
Banagher, what are you doing?!
Shoot her!

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:46.210
Don't interfere!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:51.380
You'll pay! You'll pay! You'll pay!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.420
This stagnant, black feeling...

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.960
There's no point in becoming stained
through and through with it.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:10.130
Don't let it consume you, Ms. Loni!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:14.840
Children are always consumed by
their parents' wishes, Banagher.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.300
I'm not wrong!

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:19.010
That's not a wish!
It's a curse!

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.960
It's the same thing! You carry out
what was entrusted to you!

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:24.430
That's the duty of the 
children bound by blood

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:25.940
to the parents who gave them life!

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:30.300
And you're one to talk, your power was
given to you by your parents, too!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:38.300
This is my war!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:45.130
Get on, Banagher!

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:51.510
We have to exceed the reaction speed
of those reflectors.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:54.010
- How's your beam magnum?
- One shot left.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:56.010
- It all comes down to one shot, then.
- Mr. Riddhe...

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:59.210
Do it! It's the only way
to protect the city!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:02.550
We'll fly around and then charge
straight at the chest.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:05.010
We'll split up as we pass her,
attack simultaneously,

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:06.420
and break through in one spot!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:12.880
Sieg Zeon, Sieg Zeon,
Sieg Zeon...

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:23.960
Sieg Zeon, Sieg Zeon,
Sieg Zeon, Sieg Zeon...

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.960
Ms. Loni! Come back!

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.300
Give it up, already!

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:38.840
Sieg Zeon!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:44.840
Loni... Our war is over.

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:58.380
- Ms. Loni...
- Banagher, shoot while you can!

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:09.210
You're risking your life
over a possibility!

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:12.590
Just give up on it and let go!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.130
Banagher.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.760
It's sad, isn't it?

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.090
I can't shoot!

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:00.260
The massive mobile armor
has stopped moving.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:03.460
The other Zeon Remnant mobile suits
seem to have been mopped up.

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:06.260
Verifying damage to Torrington Base.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:09.340
Get me Romeo 008 first.

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:14.630
Flaste, take us out of this airspace.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.510
Come down from there, Banagher.

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.710
A seizure order has been
issued for that Gundam.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:39.260
Step out and hand it over.

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:40.550
Ensign Riddhe...

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:46.300
If it weren't for you, none of this
would have happened.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:57.210
A black...

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:00.380
Unicorn...?

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:41.420
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:44.090
BANAGHER LINKS, SOLDIER

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:48.510
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
